## 3. Decode: FLOPs and bytes per output token

One step drafts 5 tokens, verifies 6 rows through all 40 layers and emits {{ w.decode_step.accept_len }} tokens on
average. With independent routing, the 6 verify rows touch **{{ w.decode_step.distinct_experts_verify|n(1) }}
distinct experts per layer**. The drafter touches {{ w.decode_step.distinct_experts_draft|n(1) }} per block. One step reads
**{{ (w.decode_step.unique_bytes/1e9)|n(1) }} GB** of unique bytes and performs {{ (w.decode_step.flops/1e9)|n(0) }} GFLOP.
